& [IR7FinalSliceSurfaceV1] is the executable slice surface for IR7 operations dry-run request simulator planning
  + [chunk_ref] is IR7 operations dry-run request simulator planning
  + [chunk_boundary] is operations boundary import, dry-run request/result/refusal contracts, resource safety and human approval contracts, fixture plan, implementation plan, activation pack, and completion review
  + [accepted_boundary_input] is docs/planning/Post_IR6_Implementation_Readiness_Surface.v1.sop
