  + [accepted_boundary_input] is docs/planning/FSC5_Operations_Safety_Pack.v1.sop
  + [accepted_boundary_input] is docs/canonical/LangSOP_Operations_Safety_Spec.canonical.sop
  + [accepted_boundary_input] is docs/planning/IR6_Coordination_Mailbox_Projection_Prototype_Implementation_Proof_Pack.v1.sop
  + [accepted_boundary_input] is docs/reviews/IR6_Implementation_Completion_Review.v1.sop
  + [unresolved_external_dependency_set] is empty_after_gate
  + [current_ready_slice] is IR7-S01
  + [gated_slice_set] is IR7-S02, IR7-S03, IR7-S04, IR7-S05, and IR7-S06
  + [safety_limit] is no live operations control authorized

  = must: execute IR7-S01 before creating dry-run contracts, resource safety contracts, fixture plans, implementation activation plans, dependency changes, executable operations simulator code, generated outputs, adapters, transports, or package metadata
  = must: run completed-work review after each IR7 slice
  = must: stale downstream slices when an upstream output changes or contradicts current assumptions
  = must: reject any output that promotes dry-run results, fixture success, human approval displays, mailbox carriers, coordination claims, operation requests, generated reports, or surface state to live-control authority

